{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1548,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ef27bad6bc0384b32a74fde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "远远看见这件衣服的瞬间，它简直在发光！\r\n拿起来一看，胸口印着Shine的字样……\r\n这绝对就是命运吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f416c8e5d6902a3a505ecf33f66db4b1c93825b1faaedfdbc905476964970070",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deafddf76e349a325abd985b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凭着我的直觉，口袋里每天装的东西都不同！\r\n之前还用随身带的胶水\r\n修好过坏掉的鞋子呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa6418ac7bc5453e91c444870262b85c62a11c7f1f8e9f99332c5ea3f7ad7ae0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd506f92d76586726e4cff8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的脚步声格外响亮！\r\n所以我会穿各种不同鞋底的鞋子，\r\n尽情享受音色的变化！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edc07ffa9f395da06e844e28ba76bda07f00568e8dea7da31970b17867d94a8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fe6c1970bd984e672353a33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多么热血沸腾的较量啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36a2028c953cddf4d3c5267886a11f30505f5680fc5c715c50db1d369bf95699",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edaba2cd5be673e4c07b94c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这结果太棒了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ab66a01a788f39c5bf634a1f5e850b8426136905a0e9b3c29bb0e7556410f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c003b5470f8a814146af66d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天会跨越过去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af0e4b13836e7a2e48c1f0bda93d9c6ee7cb6b0dbaea6028c0aeb72ee9567996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a9c91ee75f413acafb1c967",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多么热血沸腾的较量啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36a2028c953cddf4d3c5267886a11f30505f5680fc5c715c50db1d369bf95699",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f51b7f3f116f8d32d42adb80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迈向更加闪耀的未来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc13fd77cb4bf7a09f4d8a13338b62ae79124e42508696bff45bc80c2f617561",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1ec8f987f157bf8f81bfc07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一同倾听命运的声音吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "377b70ea6c58cb480cdc38fa5e06d48df8c05bd06189d2de40dfa303baf94d7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:735c96030ead466a4954eeb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52a54a7e0acacfb2761f60fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快告诉我吧！今天的菜单！\r\n兴奋与激动已经快从胸口和双腿溢出来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "baf41cff35be3107f24b4ef097184ed80c454bed4c9eb15e0077d5dbd42a3b97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59ff6e23e15ec1a7799343a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯！要想开拓未来，\r\n就不能不回顾过去的历史！\r\n我完全懂的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d48fe42c8b98812b60cd45b652dd013cd0116b451cd73ca7184007b6b2b9952",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8f359f3e98d2667a5e0344d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛事！是要跑比赛对吧！？\r\n好，我们走，现在就走！\r\n我24小时都做好了万全准备！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4093ca688d7eacd34dce93adfb96852af2fb4af6bfb5fc8629f74e8fae5cf16d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0acc4547879ab601b4bab1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fb57ac68b66f1546f9801f5aaf6a725ec4388807ec83792fcbb5cebd8d3fbba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:539b481572bb2dac6e607e70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全新命运的大门打开了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a460a921673a6ba74038ade24444a70defd14d675e8e5257b1bed0dbef2bdabb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b648cc10835e8ee82671d64e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跃跃欲试按捺不住啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94e85c6a34961b2373c5932dcca888e06ab726b1d172db57679d4fa83a208dfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "1275"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29768713ca10696cda1734b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是\r\n今天的登录奖励！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d3545bc38933a7f29e9f6011cdf7a9a5380441148550816578e37514e17c5c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43e1ec59e4b5b8cb150370db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你一定能行的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2728519daa48d80bc1e9c6ab7d223b3571b55fa16a3ebd3a638c183b7ba7ee68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b036b7baef1f13d68f5fe544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来啦来啦来啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48028479fea81018d53b5e9de7f7a7fcb6b2335d82ad694eedef2859c2b6033b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24493562b3ec61b27d0cac8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来才是正戏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d0a3428ed6ab0d35e94ad0cf9e8fe8831fe0312ae6ed632299ea72777198874",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97652bf1a8863c107ba7b433",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一把抓住命运了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57b1c3c7b6e6bb46a72d80743b32636b0ea7522e0db9c87655bf4e9103083488",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:180f7d58883d816f61fe9bca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不愧是你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8634d078a3aedfd8723a6e1fc27c3cce3b1c480dc302bcf3099d0de6dd0b217",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:148963f9435680854c7c0a9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有下一次！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4076dde7b3d8adc41ed4639538e0e0a2a7a0c8d5d7ef3af5bc5d0f4491b916dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61742305c3a68e0dfb99b249",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一把抓住命运了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57b1c3c7b6e6bb46a72d80743b32636b0ea7522e0db9c87655bf4e9103083488",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4095c64ce6881726f5e794f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不愧是你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8634d078a3aedfd8723a6e1fc27c3cce3b1c480dc302bcf3099d0de6dd0b217",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:071b5f663395a3fdb70e25cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d2346a83d1b8c2923fbbab92ed24675d7d005051cca9d31beac70e84d31b57a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfe0887fd1a9c8e529aac093",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "988dffd004b908a63af8e2497727ec5793f760d1badf3a58ea01d55f40ee75d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec2cdf47cde2e264871b83d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好兴奋啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8518efa6c070e780b2db26e9e318eeac2ebf201fdaf5cf01111760948356f355",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf690eb6b9f7f9bd0e25a509",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都跟上来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff4cea6dc112cd9b81ec7a303026bb77e5606860fca0bb737b9853f9d00bc2b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b7295671e7f09c52e0fd99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最棒的展开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b6ee286ea9bebef3ef997c573eea0e0720dc6341b0853b7d0db6d62801cc0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e37d9e626c57f229267596c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难道说散发出了引力！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "52d28217ae0e51c6ec016aa50200c37932c779c6816ac0da54e800cd19ba024d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dc5702150893c327e193360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b77f3acaa573d87b7d4e65a75f3f5a8ac6d72bee0a534a8709a548e05fa0a5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4ce7970aa34ba0e5fa7e8b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d97bf0b77d0808cf0b117b444cf6a459c044951519360353f48ac79f6910d9ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a3034fbfadfe158bf33a861",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身上直痒痒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2103c98b003f3e5889d153b3caf9103ae2e5d8fb7fc8e4468f948bf43756ecc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68ff92e6a8e3d103ebe715a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜拜啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f0e61a8a44cc35d740e98b8839ebf1e9bcb59ba40d351e06ebabd42a49daf6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4f13fa20cdf89b5cebe87b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次再见！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6973b2248484158d9bdf3c1cd085904f108df2ae5e1a93c389926fcea71ebc53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54db99bbc5527d89c2c71934",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天是这个！\r\n我现在就已经等不及啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3bbb66a5d3ba6ef8124d058a94597255e6c1b3720e96344836b3563f9836eb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c48ce641eb2106e1d882999",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇怪！明明想动起来身体却动不了！\r\n……嗯！这倒也算\r\n挺有趣的体验不是吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a1f894b9548f5ddbb2f7e106760b4e19e6df1f3721f8f8f1ad4b0e3af37ecc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adbf2bdd56a1df3f71819cda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『命运之声』在对我说……\r\n『你累了哦』――难怪身体\r\n这么沉重……！疑问解开了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a72ed74a09afb6a3fbd4e58f59904e43c31068990f60bb5eb2fa46c568b8a26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:728eb9f96491904bc0367609",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你现在心情怎么样？\r\n我这边可是满怀热切的期待，\r\n简直兴奋得快要从胸口蹦出来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6cba66c595f28452500bc4406c36a2dcf9313681d4b5097114c1e7afe6a7ed5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89e2c9fe59af99361c86f6d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯！果然只要看到你的脸，\r\n浑身就会源源不断涌出力气呢！\r\n托你的福，我今天也是火力全开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3d1497fc51b3a52f592134599a0897b63041e10d63cc2360cf7d32dc2c6e9c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e294fc57722740b66eabddb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的脚步声也别具一格！\r\n你看……咚跶咚跶的声音，\r\n比平时高了整整一个八度呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cf97fbc61e63d605db1434c9b4d63b25c59027c18e551e81afd7f839fae4d27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:891c6e7bec9eb00cd8cc8d7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的操场看起来在闪闪发光……\r\n那是当然的啦！在这里的训练，\r\n可是与辉煌灿烂的未来紧密相连的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0832871eaa1761a91ca2ed6e7e586f8f2aee2a903569d205c618cc788fc8d301",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70b826fe8aa03c9302dc086a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，朝着等待着我们的命运，\r\n一起进发吧！跨越了那里之后？\r\n当然是奔向下一个、再下一个命运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24647b8ccf9e386e77645370d3d1ba6fb6c49b5b39fd2d65b8a7bad8acf65432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7c70089dcf0f1264d1de92c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我就知道，\r\n你也差不多该过来了！\r\n好，我们开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0ff4e66b1d77c42354e73aa56bad1bd99c12fa3c2e7f90fb6905ffbe1771511",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddfc2358485574177ceaa0b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也把菜单轻松搞……\r\n轻……香脆轻松……哎呀！？\r\n突然好想吃香脆的法式薄饼了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e637a4faf586951cb37341d0ccb61251b0a67e034cb3f77f358af30ef95c5b01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f83d9506582e7a572e15f439",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔――！总觉得，连脚步声\r\n都和平时不同，变得好安分啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec38fe6fc1dfed7b719ab434edcd5cc9efc1e85d6691c7751b596cf1367c818",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cfb6331b6026bb8f6efdf83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嗯，我懂了！\r\n今天不是训练的日子！\r\n我们一起出去玩吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c998c06c0e6ddc0241dc98bf3ba609cfaaa60822cfa85fe3dd9b07c871863806",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9daa94147ad9ac3e9f0f8a76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平时命运之声总会在背后推我一把的……\r\n今天却相反，就像是被什么东西\r\n往后拽着一样……唔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a72fddaca0767a2846709af3e140540a93fd931f8d02a1f0980d912a40231e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aec51cf4079379f6bb06d26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『命运之声』\r\n正在疯狂打连环夺命call啊！？\r\n大喊着『快住手』……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "819e0a8390ab3343dd55e8c6b79c267958da07c55984db6bc4b8511a795ce7a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3985c7194e7f6015be86418e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……这真的是你的意志吗？\r\n现在的我，\r\n已经有些搞不懂你了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc63897c92a9912ae915ba7758353cda89a4eba160b444910e328f1c39b4bbac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4f24cafce24b5169d042d80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "声音，从大清早就在回响了。\r\n我明白的……\r\n今天正是命运降临的时刻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e55e6f0ebac88e942728dab9f2a150818ef4feebfae2dac7f39ed152c1f2f51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80c3083912bc308a88a52900",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一刻，我们\r\n早已等候多时！用我的双腿，\r\n伴着你的呼喊，纵情贯穿命运吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb4942c10d688dedc6d5895079ad581f144c34aa333c1e5721307c942a2eaa0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04ff2f3acce374c32aee1c1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冲破极限的天球，通往无限命运的\r\n道路，由我来开拓！今天\r\n将要引发的，没错！就是宇宙大爆炸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b439f6a89fe394d3e814abb506051b4d111acbd495bdf3a0c6807d94c4fca352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aec9ebdf052d2a1197b65699",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完全和计划的一样！那是理所当然的！\r\n因为，这可是我和你\r\n齐心协力努力至今的成果啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42401c754992c172936085b7b598875b2b3225aa80c0596f2bd82de768ac6775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c846ae1324b71da67e6d4c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的双腿，你的后盾支援，\r\n今天就要在此处开拓出未来！\r\n来吧，让命运回响起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0053d6c23358e573b135f7a8efd51ed578c65702191461137e83cd923061b449",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ead8fe41b4238942c4a0727",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很期待我的奔跑吧！？\r\n但我可不会仅仅“如你所料”就结束！\r\n我要彻底超越你的想象！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1903367a102ea1e1362c9cbaecaacd23c8caddd485e626a14973dae127a77bc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51ce1ac998c5c367959e4101",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态普通！\r\n和平时那个如出一辙的我！\r\n换句话说！那就是绝对能赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c2686d9b2d90eb6ffc3bd6cfb99c8762822f1fc4c2409d40037520129ff744e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e990e45aaa3abeb317356ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从早上开始就激动不已！\r\n胸口这股莫名的悸动……大家听到\r\n命运之声的日子，难道就是今天吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "057e53eea5ecc925ed7ce494496ebef96df810d472d3538076885d8cb2fde924",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaf95f7db6dced41439c554e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做好心理准备吧。\r\n因为我马上就会让你见识到\r\n令人心跳加速大呼过瘾的精彩表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f8e2f2ab13de6b2d55737381954d285e54d665bf7f1f239dba7ffa4b39bc42f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ec6d9d12408cd6912c68c34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态如何根本无关紧要！\r\n我只要拼尽全力，去完成唯有我\r\n才能做到的使命就行了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a08b75c6274b961099a1f0434397480a4cf64641c08884c187911080fb11edbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:069bd4f884624bb323142d6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要说状态不佳有什么影响……大概也就是\r\n太兴奋很难睡得着吧！\r\n因为太期待赛事了！所以没问题的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90407ee0caf6abfe3c3fbc5f7a6502c0b3cbe1f4dcc68642701ecf5e86a8cd48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5edd749171e22b14d120734c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没事的，通往胜利的道路\r\n我已经看得清清楚楚！剩下所需要的\r\n……嗯！就是你在背后推我一把了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "676fb8509c81d73387271ef9f28cb33a0f2c51ccc6f189b7e28b85e18102ffab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6970aaaa44f88f94a2c4f5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你没有任何错误。\r\n因为接下来……\r\n我就要让你亲眼见识命运的大逆转！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ec9c9170c3f4fc000ff5809278de3b5179b56e849ac06782c6d9c2a421e2ee8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a256f5e5ec5d7af2f1487408",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的心……现在，正噗通噗通狂跳！\r\n跨越千钧一发的极限胜负，\r\n去开拓未知的命运吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffa4e02386a687537c7ccfb7158732ca25e00de0bae74073ca62d0795f60dec6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e104f57d316c26bc3afafaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表情很担忧嘛！那就说好了！\r\n看我用我的奔跑，把你的脸庞\r\n涂满灿烂耀眼的笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8df18e0f6930962c4fe0917664ffe165b25b9ad36492d656cf21ff1366707292",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04203c6d64515b64991e25f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ae969104f8945a333521f8f33beb56b4d63e0abf37794e7ece0e0832f7a5356",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddc15e36fdf3672d246a39d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "473b6a2acb2d8cfec9b5252fb7239c795cc8ad473460f43050df98f509964a34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc14d49ef639cfb2396f82ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好期待啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa73eb42cacf90aa701bb8f1bc1126fffe82c55f8cf767604ddab373e4e0ffc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55df2c949f1912e889b1ab55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "367c3c090bb0cb242aae593bde2fb66986290df1f64be4ff8c71e7ff2ddb1029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:009e540d16e57889087512b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7523a9e48d63e72f2e050b875720b859401b4fa2c48d277ea7edb9ab7bc4799",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be802925966451a3fe1d63f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "059c0f0b27929aa87c5b6a7985342939a8bd1bae2a57b570e54c591e8e612bb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b88c40eb5db2eb4909d908f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走起走起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "635adf7b084fcc6372e72bab16d2261c30f25db34c3ce2b156b539bfc75bfc1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebe8b73c0e309d59e1602224",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无限大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5d6cf10a4bae576f4e748706d57be7ddcabfe9db29dae359ad7465446ece18c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52d4cb1b21c6280bb26c0a3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是你的呼喊，在背后推了我一把！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74e8596313320393f93a5e0db90bcd9d8d02c7e63c73f9e77ec2b440694f9d84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50ce53e11dbe77e34fe4a3e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你在一起超开心的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bd3511767f5f63dcce3ac8084b5227980549ad92198ebb0c08c1db204869718",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54c54217c4b18704dd2c2fda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "道路由我来开拓！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af92a9efaa802a99f8d55877dd7cc2495cd7a231b67ac02857d361c5961cc996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de33733b99252637efad0ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一同倾听命运的声音吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "377b70ea6c58cb480cdc38fa5e06d48df8c05bd06189d2de40dfa303baf94d7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92213e2ace46e99e8094210e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你在一起超开心的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bd3511767f5f63dcce3ac8084b5227980549ad92198ebb0c08c1db204869718",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edf941994b6e3007827c36ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很期待我的奔跑吧！？\r\n但我可不会仅仅“如你所料”就结束！\r\n我要彻底超越你的想象！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1903367a102ea1e1362c9cbaecaacd23c8caddd485e626a14973dae127a77bc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "2033"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
